{"articleNo":"85326","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85326&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업] 취업대비 1:1맞춤컨설팅 시행(6월 27일까지 상반기 종료)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.18","hit":"4135","attachments":[{"name":"2013년 밀착형취업대비 1대1 맞춤컨설팅 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85326&attachNo=71654"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><font size=\"5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013년 상반기 밀착형취업대비 1:1 맞춤컨설팅 시행</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">우리 대학교 재학생들에게 올바른 취업 방향을 제시하고, 취업준비생들의 </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">지원(예정)기업에 대한 입사지원서 진단 및 면접 대비&nbsp;맞춤컨설팅을 통해 취업준비생의 만족도 및 취업률 증대를&nbsp;위해 아래와 같이 <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">「밀착형</font></strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">취업대비 1:1 맞춤컨설팅」</font></strong> 을 시행하오니 재학생 및 취업준비중인 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 목&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 : 취업준비생 취업역량 강화를 통한 취업률 제고</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 과업내용</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> </font></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffcc99\" height=\"46\" valign=\"center\" width=\"103\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">주요내용</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"center\" width=\"458\"><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -5.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;취업준비, 취업동향, 취업진단, 취업애로, 기업정보, 입사지원, 직무적성, 면접, 서류작성 및 클리닉, 합격전